ketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=I-BUPWzMumgQ7kNvwEgLtsc&_nc_oc=Adrz9YeasY9i-1XUDQN0aGEMSRafZksAq4LqSCnogJ6kyQPzAKAqYkZYqLmCxs75i2M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSQ7Hx_w7ET6-3sbK_X9gvWJYfNYxP6ye2RbLmd5Ck7ug&oe=6AFC865C"}, {"file_name": "GlobalLeaderboards_Image.png", "id": "556916340796636", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618051_556916344129969_4630520520253278561_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_vYJLrgMMTYQ7kNvwH9r9DZ&_nc_oc=AdqpylwerVynH79eIXLwto7RSBDc0ypfM_UM9aBpwQ-afIo-6BvhDPnSg7JpC1xLG8M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSVU9Dl19cMhSGY7e21yBpgIJybVPxro1gxbnMRts1l5Q&oe=6AFC8FA0"}, {"file_name": "ChallengeMode_Image.png", "id": "1238200904331680", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499301526_1238200907665013_4439728854047711627_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dp-5DDiafuwQ7kNvwG99Reh&_nc_oc=AdpNvWkjiM3WHhBAd61pc2TWo9Q_8a4c4pCKcs3OBcDZnFobhMRe-ERXmRLijALQupI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSvtFU0RKDL2eYDZSHtoFV0dHXQ41PxD8DrI9Wov_dATA&oe=6AFC856B"}, {"file_name": "Cosmetics_Image.png", "id": "1366120307973125", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499300977_1366120311306458_2475007633126940757_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1XeX68w1C_0Q7kNvwHf2yBF&_nc_oc=AdqEZsKnw9QarJbC5lOcS6dlgfE0Lgnxl5TCvCZRDX9Pj8R_42Dw9u8iSFMVtLXaqPc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSokxGUC_wzWDJCg06nGpLNyFAiIvPbVwcEoIo5b1Z_hg&oe=6AFC7D3B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Punch Bomb", "keywords": ["Punch", "Arcade", "Bomb", "Game", "Challenge"], "long_description": "# Do you like to punch things?!\nPunch Bomb is an intense action arcade game where you punch things designed from the ground up for those who like a challenge!\n\nThis game **IS NOT EASY**\n\nClimb the global leaderboards in 3 punchable game modes!\n\n\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\n# Classic Mode\n\n\n\nSurvive for as long as you can while punching a variety of bombs away from you before they explode, racking up huge combos, hitting targets, and dodging dangerous laser obstacles!\n{4009259875886708}\n\n\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\n\n\n# Blitz Mode\n\nRegular bombs no longer explode in this mode, and targets extend your time. Go ballistic to try to get as high of a score as possible within the time limit!\n{1063827595628759}\n\n\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\n\n\n# Challenge Mode\nComplete a fun collection of small challenges that put your speed and accuracy to the test!\n{1207719874395696}\n\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\n\n# Unique Cosmetics\nUnlock a variety of unique cosmetics by **PLAYING THE GAME** if you're up for a good challenge! Each with their own unique particle effect!\n\n\n\n\n{1198946195348915}", "short_description": "Do you like to punch things?! Punching bombs away from you before they explode while dodging dangerous laser obstacles and hitting targets! Compete in global leaderboards across 3 punchable game modes!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://punchbomb.com/punchbombTOS.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://punchbomb.com/punchbombTOS.html", "publisher_name": "Chris Folea Makes Things", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.punchbomb.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": 